hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"185","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab janaabat se ghusl kartey to shuru kartey aur apney haath dhotey, phir wuzu kartey jaisey namaz key liye wuzu kartey. Phir apni ungliyaan paani mein daakhil kartey aur un se apne baalon ki jadon ka khilaal kartey, phir apne sar par apne donon haathon se teen chullu daaltey, phir apni saari jild par paani bahaatey. (Bukhari: 248)"
"186","[AI-translation] Maimoona (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz key wuzu jaisa wuzu kya, apne pairon key siwa. Aur apni sharmgaah dhoi aur jo takleef (najaasat) usey lagi thi, phir us par paani bahaaya. Phir apney paon hata kar unhey dhoya. Ye Aap ka janaabat se ghusl tha. (Bukhari: 249)"
"187","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik bartan, aik pyaaley se ghusl kartey they jisey Faraq kaha jaata hai. (Bukhari: 250)"
"188","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai ke un se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ghusl key baarey mein poochha gaya. To unhon-ne saa key qareeb bartan manga aur ghusl kya aur apne sar par (paani) bahaaya, jabke unkey aur poochhney waley key darmiyaan parda tha. (Bukhari: 251)"
"189","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se aik aadmi ne ghusl key baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey saa kaafi hai. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Mujhey kaafi nahi hai. To Jaabir ne kaha: Wo usey kaafi tha jo tum se zyada baalon wala aur tum se behtar tha. Phir unhon-ne hamein kapdey mein (namaz) padhaai. (Bukhari: 252)"
"190","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin main apne sar par teen martaba (paani) bahaata hun. Aur Aap ne apne donon haathon se ishaara kya. (Bukhari: 254)"
"191","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab janaabat se ghusl kartey to doodh dohaney key bartan jaisi cheez mangaatey. To apni hatheli se letey aur apne sar key daaen hissey se shuru kartey phir baaen se, phir un donon se apne sar key darmiyaan par (paani) daaltey. (Bukhari: 258)"
"192","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khushbu lagaati to Aap apni biwiyon key paas jaatey, phir subah ehraam baandhtey jabke khushbu tapak rahi hoti. (Bukhari: 267)"
"193","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat aur din ki aik ghadi mein apni biwiyon key paas jaatey jabke wo gyaarah thein. Kaha gaya: Kya Aap iski taaqat rakhtey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham baat kartey they ke Aap ko tees (mardon) ki quwwat di gai thi. (Bukhari: 268)"
"194","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Goya main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maanq mein khushbu ki chamak dekh rahi hun jabke Aap ehraam baandhey huey hain. (Bukhari: 271)"
"195","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab janaabat se ghusl kartey to apney haath dhotey aur namaz key wuzu jaisa wuzu kartey, phir ghusl kartey. Phir apne haath se apne baalon ka khilaal kartey yahan tak ke jab gumaan kartey ke Aap ne apni khaal seraab kar di hai to us par teen martaba paani bahaatey, phir apna baaqi jism dhotey. (Bukhari: 272)"
"196","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Namaz key liye iqaamat kahi gai aur safein khadey honay key liye seedhi ki gaein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamaarey paas nikley. Phir jab Aap apne musalley mein khadey huey to yaad aaya ke Aap junbi hain. To ham se farmaya: Apni jagah (raho). Phir wapas gaey aur ghusl kya, phir hamaarey paas nikley jabke Aap ka sar tapak raha tha. To takbeer kahi aur ham ne Aap key sath namaz padhi. (Bukhari: 275)"
"197","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israel nangey ghusl kartey they, un mein se baaz baaz ko dekhta tha. Aur Musa (Alaihissalam) akeley ghusl kartey they. To unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Musa ko hamaarey sath ghusl karney se sirf ye rokta hai ke wo aadar (ke marz mein mubtala) hain. To aik martaba wo ghusl karney gaey aur apna kapda patthar par rakkha. To patthar unkey kapdey key sath bhaag gaya. To Musa uskey peechey nikley aur kehtey they: Mera kapda ae patthar! Yahan tak ke Bani Israel ne Musa ko dekh liya. To unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Musa mein koi kharaabi nahi hai. Aur unhon-ne apna kapda liya aur patthar ko maarney lagey. To Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak us (maar) se patthar par chhe ya saat nishaan hain, patthar par maarney se. (Bukhari: 278)"
"198","[AI-translation] Aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jabke Ayyub nangey ghusl kar rahey they ke un par soney ki tidiyaan girnein. To Ayyub apne kapdey mein sametney lagey. To unkey Rab ne unhey pukaara: Ae Ayyub! Kya main ne tumhey us se beniyaaz nahi kar diya tha jo tum dekhtey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi, teri izzat ki qasam! Lekin main teri barkat se beniyaaz nahi hun. (Bukhari: 279)"
"199","[AI-translation] Umm Haani bint Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Fatah key saal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas gai to Aap ko ghusl kartey huey paaya jabke Faatima Aap ko parda kar rahi thein. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hain? To main ne kaha: Main Umm Haani hun. (Bukhari: 280)"
"200","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhey Madina key baaz raaston mein milay jabke wo junbi they. Unhon-ne kaha: To main Aap se chhup kar hata aur gaya aur ghusl kya phir aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Tum kahaan they? Unhon-ne kaha: Main junbi tha to main ne naapasand kya ke main Aap key sath baithun jabke main paaki par nahi hun. To Aap ne farmaya: SubhanAllah! Beshak Musalman naapaak nahi hota. (Bukhari: 283)"
"201","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Kya ham mein se koi junbi honay ki haalat mein so sakta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, jab tum mein se koi wuzu karey to junbi honay ki haalat mein so jaey. (Bukhari: 287)"
"202","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab (aadmi) uski chaar shaakhon (haathon pairon) key darmiyaan baithay phir us par zor lagaey to ghusl waajib ho gaya hai. (Bukhari: 291). Kitaab-ul-Haiz."
